---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy - LEEYOUNG" description="Learn about how we collect, use, and protect your personal information">
  <Header />

  <main class="policy-page">
    <div class="policy-container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span>Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>

      <h1 class="policy-title">Privacy Policy</h1>

      <div class="policy-content">
        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>I. Introduction</h2>
          <p>This Privacy Policy describes how Leeyoung (the "Site", "we", "us", or "our") collects, uses, and discloses your personal information when you visit, use our services, or make a purchase from leeyoungshop.com (the "Site") or otherwise communicate with us regarding the Site (collectively, the "Services"). For purposes of this Privacy Policy, "you" and "your" means you as the user of the Services, whether you are a customer, website visitor, or another individual whose information we have collected pursuant to this Privacy Policy.</p>

          <p>We collect personal information solely to provide and improve our Services, fulfill orders, and comply with legal obligations. Our website is not designed for data harvesting or marketing research as its primary function.</p>

          <p>Please read this Privacy Policy carefully. By using and accessing any of the Services, you agree to the collection, use, and disclosure of your information as described in this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree to this Privacy Policy, please do not use or access any of the Services.</p>

          <p>This Privacy Policy is governed by and complies with the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA).</p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>II. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time, including to reflect changes to our practices or for other operational, legal, or regulatory reasons. We will post the revised Privacy Policy on the Site, update the "Last updated" date and take any other steps required by applicable law.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>III. How We Collect and Use Your Personal Information</h2>
          <p>To provide the Services, we collect and have collected over the past 12 months personal information about you from a variety of sources, as set out below. The information that we collect and use varies depending on how you interact with us.</p>

          <p>In addition to the specific uses set out below, we may use information we collect about you to communicate with you, provide or improve or improve the Services, comply with any applicable legal obligations, enforce any applicable terms of service, and to protect or defend the Services, our rights, and the rights of our users or others.</p>

          <p>We do not offer free gifts or incentives solely in exchange for your personal information. Any promotions that include a gift or reward are part of a purchase transaction or bona fide marketing events, and not primarily intended to collect your data.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>IV. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>The types of personal information we obtain about you depends on how you interact with our Site and use our Services. When we use the term "personal information", we are referring to information that identifies, relates to, describes or can be associated with you. The following sections describe the categories and specific types of personal information we collect.</p>

          <h3>1. Information You Provide</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Order Details:</strong> Name, shipping address, email, phone number.</li>
            <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Username, password (encrypted).</li>
            <li><strong>Payment Information:</strong> Transaction details processed via PayPal (we do not store credit card numbers or PayPal passwords).</li>
            <li><strong>Communications:</strong> Content from emails or customer support forms.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3>2. Automatically Collected Information</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Device & Usage Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, visit timestamps, page interactions (via cookies).</li>
            <li><strong>Geolocation:</strong> Approximate location based on IP (for tax calculation).</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>V. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Contract Fulfillment:</strong> Process orders, arrange shipping, and provide customer support.</li>
            <li><strong>Service Improvement:</strong> Analyze user behavior to enhance website functionality.</li>
            <li><strong>Marketing:</strong> Send product updates and promotions with your consent (opt-out anytime). We will not use your personal information or images in any advertising or promotional materials without your prior, explicit consent. You may withdraw consent at any time by contacting us.</li>
            <li><strong>Security & Compliance:</strong> Detect fraud and comply with legal obligations.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>VI. Data Sharing</h2>

          <h3>1. Third-Party Service Providers</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Payment Processing:</strong> PayPal (subject to their Privacy Policy).</li>
            <li><strong>Platform Operations:</strong> Shopify (data handling per their Terms).</li>
          </ul>

          <h3>2. Legal Compliance</h3>
          <p>We may disclose information in response to valid legal requests (e.g., subpoenas, government inquiries).</p>

          <p><strong>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to any third party for monetary or other valuable consideration.</strong></p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>VII. Your Rights</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Access & Correction:</strong> View or edit data via your account.</li>
            <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of non-essential data (exceptions apply for legal retention).</li>
            <li><strong>Opt-Out of Marketing:</strong> Unsubscribe via email links or account settings.</li>
            <li><strong>Data Portability:</strong> Request export of your order history.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>VIII. Cookie Policy</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> For cart functions and login (cannot be disabled).</li>
            <li><strong>Analytics Cookies:</strong> Anonymous traffic data via Google Analytics (opt-out available).</li>
            <li><strong>Advertising Cookies:</strong> Used for personalized ads only with consent (manage via cookie banner).</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>IX. Security Measures</h2>
          <p><strong>Technical Safeguards:</strong> SSL encryption, regular security audits. All pages on which you enter payment information (including credit card details) are protected by industry‑standard TLS/SSL encryption to ensure the confidentiality and integrity of your data while in transit.</p>

          <p><strong>Data Minimization:</strong> Collect only essential data; retain for ≤3 years (exceptions apply).</p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>X. Policy Updates</h2>
          <p>We may update this policy periodically. Revised versions will be posted on the Site with an updated "Last Updated" date.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>XI. Security and Retention of Your Information</h2>
          <p>Please be aware that no security measures are perfect or impenetrable, and we cannot guarantee "perfect security." In addition, any information you send to us may not be secure while in transit. We recommend that you do not use insecure channels to communicate sensitive or confidential information to us.</p>

          <p>How long we retain your personal information depends on different factors, such as whether we need the information to maintain your account, to provide the Services, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes or enforce other applicable contracts and policies.</p>
        </section>

        <div class="policy-contact">
          <h3>Contact</h3>
          <p>Should you have any questions about our privacy practices or this Privacy Policy, or if you would like to exercise any of the rights available to you, please email us at:</p>
          <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:customerservice@leeyoungshop.com">customerservice@leeyoungshop.com</a></p>
          <p><strong>Physical address:</strong> 30 N Gould St Ste R, Sheridan, WY 82801</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .policy-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: #fafafa;
    padding: 100px 0 4rem;
  }

  .policy-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #666;
  }

  .breadcrumb a {
    color: #666;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }

  .breadcrumb a:hover {
    color: #000;
  }

  .breadcrumb span {
    color: #999;
  }

  .policy-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .policy-content {
    background: #fff;
    padding: 3rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  .policy-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
  }

  .policy-section:last-of-type {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .policy-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .policy-section h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #000;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .policy-section p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .policy-section ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 2rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .policy-section li {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .policy-contact {
    background: #f8f8f8;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .policy-contact h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .policy-contact p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .policy-contact a {
    color: #d4af37;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .policy-contact a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .policy-page {
      padding: 80px 0 3rem;
    }

    .policy-container {
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
    }

    .policy-content {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .policy-title {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }

    .policy-section h2 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    .policy-section h3 {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
